# T-248 (2026-09-04): run-time artifacts. scripts/ops_log.py appends to
# docs/reports/OPS_LOG_<trading-day>.md every few seconds while the stack runs,
# so the tree can never be clean during RTH and `git pull` — the FIRST step of
# every agent session — fails with "You have unstaged changes". 44 commits in a
# week were nothing but this log tail, and `git stash` on it truncated 1,843
# lines on 2026-09-02. The file stays on disk (verify_t17_e2e reads it by glob);
# only git stops tracking it. History keeps every past version.
docs/reports/OPS_LOG_*.md
